=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Beadeaux} **from {z:Pashhow Marshlands}** as a {p:Dark Knight} to receive a cutscene to start the quest.
** The easiest way there is using the Beadeaux {p:Survival Guide}, exiting to Pashhow Marshlands, then re-entering Beadeaux.
** **You may complete the rest of this quest on a job other than {p:Dark Knight}.**
* Farm {m:Topaz Quadav} until you acquire a {i:Quadav Mage Blood}.
** Only one is needed, even if you're doing this with a group of multiple players.
* Enter {z:Middle Delkfutt's Tower} by either climbing up from {z:Lower Delkfutt's Tower} or climbing down from the {z:Upper Delkfutt's Tower} {p:Home Point}.
* Use the teleporter at (J-6) on the **7th floor**. You will arrive at a circular chamber on the 6th floor with no exits and a ???.
* Trade the {i:Quadav Mage Blood} to the ??? to spawn {m:Gerwitz's Scythe} NM and two {m:Scythe Victims|Scythe Victim}.
* Defeat all 3 mobs and stand on the teleporter to go back upstairs.
** You only need to defeat {m:Gerwitz's Scythe} in order to progress, but the other two mobs are weaker and it's likely faster to kill them than sleep them.
* Upon taking the teleport back, you will receive a cutscene and your reward.

